I found a bug I haven't seen anyone mention yet.  I was playing in wizard
mode for fun and education in NH3.0 pl 6 on a PC.  I had just wished for
blessed +127 gauntlets of power and was starting to put them on.  Unfor-
tunately, I was under attack by several things at the time.  (I was in
Hell trying to kill the Wiz.)  Anyway, between the time I executed the
Wear command and had completed it, something caused my gloves to disappear
(stolen perhaps?).  The game said "Unknown glove type (112)" and gave the
program in disorder message.  Apparently, the program was trying to look
for gloves that no longer existed to give me the appropriate attributes.
I'm not sure if the game was really in serious disorder or not since I
never before played in wizard mode and got into such a situation.  I'm
one of those people who has yet to survive the 6th level, so I'm not sure
if later being unable to move despite the 25 strength of the gauntlets
was the result of xan attacks or the result of something wrong.  I didn't
notice getting hit by a xan, but with so many things attacking, I don't
know for sure.  I tried to rest for quite a while, as well as potions
of extra healing and lembas wafers, but I simply could not move, so I
gave up.




